   check ok: the counts reconcile: CRM active = local + quarantined + 0 missing - 1 extra
   [retry] 429 on GET Contacts(c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000032), Retry-After: 1 -> wait 1000 ms, attempt 2
   [retry] 503 on GET Contacts (next page), Retry-After: none -> wait 178 ms, attempt 2
   repaired 3 (the CRM wins); rerun: drift 0, checksums equal
   check ok: after repair the checksums are equal and the drift is zero

